  "releaseNotes": "Version 2.30.36 - AM002 generic nullability flow hardening\n\n            Changed:\n            - AM002 diagnostic messages now preserve constructed generic source/destination type arguments\n            - AM002 default-value scaffolds use default! for generic/reference fallback defaults where plain default remains nullable\n            - Added regression coverage for generic type-parameter nullable mappings and null-forgiving fallback flow\n\n            Validation:\n            - Full solution test suite passing on net10.0 (827 tests)\n            - Rule catalog and sample diagnostics snapshot checks passing\n            - GitHub PR checks passing\n            - git diff --check clean\n\n            Previous Release: v2.30.35 - AM030 converter diagnostics split",
